[ PROPERTY OVERVIEW ]
This beautiful 3 Bed, 2 Bath condo is conveniently located on Dolores Street @ 25th Street within a 3-unit building. The unit features plenty of natural light and hardwood flooring throughout. There are 3 bedrooms with closet space including a master suite with barnyard door and a remodeled bath. There is a fully remodeled kitchen with all stainless steel appliances. The kitchen flows into the formal dining area and connects right into the spacious living room with decorative fireplace. The unit also includes an in-unit Washer and Dryer, Storage in the Basement, and Shared Backyard. There is NO PARKING.
=========================================
[ COMMUNITY FEATURES ]
// HEALTH & WELLNESS: Private exercise suite fully outfitted for daily workouts.
// RESIDENT SERVICES: On-site reception staff on duty for package security and controlled access.
// UTILITY PACKAGE: Bundled utility arrangement rolled directly into the base lease rate.
// PROPERTY OPERATIONS: Responsive maintenance team and clean common areas.
=========================================
[ INQUIRIES ]
Showings are currently scheduled by appointment. Please send a direct message with your contact details and desired lease start date to receive additional information.
